      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Key implementation details\n- Self-match guard: scripts are root + setsid (no tty); student activity = observed uid + tty filter\n- Activation horizon: checks only see events newer than GYM_SINCE_*_SEQ (moved on rejected attempts)\n- Shell discovery is on demand: procfs scan of the user's shells with a controlling tty\n- Built-in wait_* checks block until met; --now for level tasks, --timeout otherwise\n- Run records (stdout/stderr 4 KiB each) go to JSONL, never into progress.json\n- --live strips solve: blocks from unit files on startup",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key implementation details\n- Self-match guard: scripts are root + setsid (no tty); student activity = observed uid + tty filter\n- Activation horizon: checks only see events newer than GYM_SINCE_*_SEQ (moved on rejected attempts)\n- Shell discovery is on demand: procfs scan of the user's shells with a controlling tty\n- Built-in wait_* checks block until met; --now for level tasks, --timeout otherwise\n- Run records (stdout/stderr 4 KiB each) go to JSONL, never into progress.json\n- --live strips solve: blocks from unit files on startup",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
