      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "\n  scripts run as uid=0 under setsid (no tty) -> never counted as student activity\n\n  only events with seq > GYM_SINCE_EXEC_SEQ / GYM_SINCE_LINE_SEQ count\n\n  a non-zero exit is a rejected attempt: horizon moves, GYM_CHECK_ATTEMPT++\n\n  a shell function: POST /hint over gym.sock, then exit 42\n\n  strips solve: blocks from unit.md, disables /api/debug",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n  scripts run as uid=0 under setsid (no tty) -> never counted as student activity\n\n  only events with seq > GYM_SINCE_EXEC_SEQ / GYM_SINCE_LINE_SEQ count\n\n  a non-zero exit is a rejected attempt: horizon moves, GYM_CHECK_ATTEMPT++\n\n  a shell function: POST /hint over gym.sock, then exit 42\n\n  strips solve: blocks from unit.md, disables /api/debug",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
